    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Yuda a lawaalmoó Yesu Kristo nee slám a hhiyoó Yakobo. Aníng barwaárí ngina gooiím dír mukdá' taa ateét nee Mungú, kudá' taa slaá' nee Mungú Baabá, nee kiri amohhe'eemiís as Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurtleemu nee wayda nee sla'aari kingi ló'wa tlahhasi dirhunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sla'aaruúse, aníng kángw ba/ama nguwa dirhúng i gooiim una ló'wa slaá'. Nee ba/amarí a toorén atén sleémeero. Ala aníng ana tsaáhh adór gár hariím gooiro tar kuungá' nuwa gurbuu'. Gurbu'ungw'eé' a kwí kuungá' haratlintaao sageeslaqwaak, tidá' Mungú aa saayín dír mukós sagaáwa wák wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma mukko i deer oo naa qawti dah. Mukwí kuna sakwasleemarí i gooín iimír aáng wa ale. A múk Munguú da'ayuumitaaká, slám a múk tsuuqaá Mungú harneét ar hotaá tlákw. Nee inooín kudá' úr oo kilós, Aakoorén Yesu Kristo, ngu sa tlaankiyá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí ngun dirhúngií inslawtisár wa slaá', ala tam ugwa geerií xui'i, gídaabá Aako mukós nguwa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ba/amís, aluuwo mukdá' inós gwa haratlintii'iiká guri qwaareés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee malayke sleeme tidá' taa uráy i haniís, uray'ín kudá' taa sláy kwaa gaárií xuiiká, ala didár hotaín wa hariim kari geexáy. Gawaá adoorihe Mungú gari tseék baraá giwti ar tseegamór alhhe'eesay wasl, as kiwa sakwasleemuuti bál deelór sakwasleemár ure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk gixsár Sodoma nee Gomora inslawaak sleeme, nee múk gixsadaá hatlá' awa bihheedií tsewen. Inooín sleeme adoodár malaykeedá' kana tleéhh, tsaatu'uuma kana eehár, ilatleerír tlakw baraá slaqooine ina baaliín, tam tsaatu'uumadár tlakw ar iringeé kana tlehhiít. Mukwí kwaa sakwasleemuút baraá aslá alhhe'eesoó koomaaká as tawa slaqsaay tleehhiti dír múk hatlae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam mukwí naa tla/angwhúng i dah sleeme aqo adoodá'. Inooín baraá tlataín awa tawooro slaqooín kin slasla/areemiis, tan siaasii' kiwa baliiti nee Mungú, nee kudá' xirfayen awa gawaá doori kin /ooslislín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam Mikaeli, malaykamoodá' úr, qoomár tiwa tlaampa'aasiyé' nee Neetlaangw daanduú slaqwtá Mosewo, aa qiitliiká sleeme nguwa /ooslin, aqo ina oó', «Aako kuúng u iigahhaati.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukwí muruudá' ta tsatsahhanká kun /ooslislín. Nee inooín ilatleeridá' taa slaqooín altleéhh ngin eeharahariyá' adoodá' makaá fuqurángw kooma'aaká sleeme i tlehhahhitiya', gawaá adoorihe inooín i hhaná' as hotaá adoorí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí a tsaxwaaín. Asma inooín loohír Kaini kana eehár. Tari /eét baraá dakuúsadár Bala'amu, as tawa bu'utuú slai, inooín tari qwaár baraá dee/aanuú adór kuduú Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A múk hhitár huwahuúw baraá dinku'uumarhúng tidár muruú /aymár sla'aariro. Tan al /ayín nee kuungá' ar mure wasle. Inooín kilooín tin xuiyá'. Inooín a adór huunkoó tar hi'iimiiti nee fur'a, ala i tluwoó konká. Slám inooín a adór xaa'aá mamaá kooma'aaká qoomár hariímár mamaá xaaiwo, kudá' taa dee/aruú al tuú/, nee niri kahiyé' niri slupuutiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín a adór gwaanduú tlawi, kudá' ila/aaro ta aleeslayká, mureewasler'ín ka geehhoo' adór sloorór gwaanduú baraá tlawi. Inooín a adór tsatse/uú tawó qwaqwadiím, kudá' dir'ín taa amohhe'eés baraá ma/ami ay alhhe'eesay wasle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Enoki a heé faanqw alaá Adamuwo. Inós aari gana oó' daanduú mukwihe iwa kaahi, «Qaytsité', Aako naa hardáh nee malaykeerós ar hhohho' ar kumér kúm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós nina hardáh as sakwasleema ngiwa tleehhi daanduú muu sleémeero. Mukdá' sleémeero oo Mungú gwa ilaiwawa/iiká guri sakwasleemuut, as daanduú tlehhemi'ii'ín kudá' sleémeero awa qwanaay taa tlehhiít, kudá' Mungú kuwa ilaiwawa/iiká. Kiri malé sakwasleemuut as daanduú axweesanaydá' xaraásl sleémeero oo tlakuuseedá' Munguú ilaiwawa/aaká aa kát daanduuwós i alé.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí a múk tawó qununuú/ nee oo naeetuús. Nee laatí inooín a múk ilatleerir'ín eeharahár. Mukwí axweesanoó daara/aangw gun ar axwees, nee bartakaaro in ilaáhhe'eemisiyá' dír múk urén as slaasláw kawa dir'ín wa slay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' sla'aaruúse, /ayma'aá aáng taa káh aáng nee Ya/abuusér Aakoorén Yesu Kristo inslawaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín tana oó', «Qoomár alhhe'eesaywo waniquuse i ti'ít ar ilatleerir'ín tidár qwanaay ga eeharahar.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí an múk wakaarír huwahuúw. Inooín muruú ta eeharahari a muruú baraaká' yaamu kilós, múk Qeeruú Mungú gu koomaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' sla'aaruuser'eé', ti kwa/ase' baraá haratlintaaorhúng tidá' ló'wa hhoohhooe, nee firiirimé' ar baraá /uuruú Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kumiité' baraá sla'aarír Munguhe, nee slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl kuwa daamaaraanda', kudá' Aako Yesu Kristo ni haniisi ar gurtleemuuwós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk xurér koóm baraá muner'ine, gurtlatlaawaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa hatlá' ba/amisaak ar kiwa baraá asltá wa dafmita'. Bahh'alé i dayá' awa ta gurtlatleera', ala ar magahhato. Tam inqwaruuín aahhaak kudá' taa slasla/aareés nee ilatleerír slaqooín.",
          "type": "text",
